# [Project name]

[One sentence: what this product does and who it's for.]

## Commands
- Install: [pnpm install]
- Dev server: [pnpm dev]
- Test (all): [pnpm test -- --run]
- Test (one file): [pnpm test -- --run path/to/file.test.ts]
- Lint + typecheck: [pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck]

## Structure
- [src/api/]: [route handlers]
- [src/lib/]: [shared helpers. Reuse these, don't duplicate them]
- [src/components/]: [UI components]
- [tests/]: [mirrors src/]

## Rules
- Plan first for anything touching more than 2 files. Show me the plan before editing.
- Match the existing patterns in the file you're editing.
- Small diffs: one concern per change.
- No new dependencies without asking.
- Run the tests before you say something works. Paste the output.

## Never
- Edit files in [migrations/] or [generated/].
- Commit `.env` files, keys or secrets.
- Push to [main]. Work on a branch.

## Definition of done
- Tests pass (output shown, not just claimed).
- Lint and typecheck clean.
- No unrelated files changed.
- You've told me what you didn't do or weren't sure about.

